In December, it's officially over for ChatGPT Chads: No more unlimited usage! 💀

@OpenAI is introducing a shared, token-based usage allowance for ChatGPT and Codex across Plus, Pro, and Business plans. The more advanced the model and the more complex the task, the faster you'll burn through your allowance.

But don't worry! Instant chat won't count toward your usage. How generous! 😏
